# Harmonized Trio: "{T}, Tap two untapped creatures you control: This creature becomes prepared." Cast on turn 1 with two
# Ornithopters, it is summoning sick, so its own {T} cost cannot be paid yet (CR 302.6) - the refusal - though the Ornithopters,
# also just cast, could be tapped for another's cost. On turn 3 it taps itself and both Ornithopters, becomes prepared (CR 722.3a)
# and Bot1 casts the Brainstorm copy from exile (CR 722.3c), which unprepares it and goes away with it.

